        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "5",
          "id": "407-5",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 15,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "The order referred to in sub-section (4) may be passed at any time before the 1st March of that tax year and it shall be followed by issuance of a demand notice under section 289.",
          "children": [],
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-5-001",
              "target_id": "407-4",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (4)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            },
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-5-002",
              "target_id": "289",
              "target_type": "section",
              "anchor_text": "section 289",
              "relationship": "depends_on",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "6",
          "id": "407-6",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 16,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "In sub-section (4), \"specified sum\" means the total income declared in the return of income or computed in regular assessment mentioned in sub-section (4)(a) and (b), respectively.",
          "children": [],
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-6-001",
              "target_id": "407-4",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (4)",
              "relationship": "definition_reference",
              "confidence": "high"
            },
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-6-002",
              "target_id": "407-4-a",
              "target_type": "clause",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (4)(a) and (b)",
              "relationship": "depends_on",
              "confidence": "high"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "7",
          "id": "407-7",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 17,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "If the notice of demand issued under section 289, as referred in sub-sections (2) and (5), is served after any of the due dates specified in section 408, the appropriate part or, the whole of the amount of the advance tax specified in such notice, shall be payable on or before each of the due date falling after the date of service of the notice of demand.",
          "children": [],
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-7-001",
              "target_id": "407-2",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-sections (2) and (5)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            },
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-7-002",
              "target_id": "289",
              "target_type": "section",
              "anchor_text": "section 289",
              "relationship": "depends_on",
              "confidence": "medium"
            },
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-7-003",
              "target_id": "408",
              "target_type": "section",
              "anchor_text": "section 408",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "8",
          "id": "407-8",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 18,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "Where a person, who is served with an order referred to in sub-section (1) or (4), estimates the advance tax payable on his current income to be lower than the amount of advance tax specified in the said order, then, he may send an intimation in the prescribed form to the Assessing Officer to that effect, and pay such advance tax on the current income, calculated in the manner laid down in section 405 as accords with his estimate, at an appropriate percentage thereof on or before the due date of each instalment specified in section 408 falling after the date of such intimation.",
          "children": [],
          "references": [
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-8-001",
              "target_id": "407-1",
              "target_type": "subsection",
              "anchor_text": "sub-section (1) or (4)",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "high"
            },
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-8-002",
              "target_id": "405",
              "target_type": "section",
              "anchor_text": "section 405",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "medium"
            },
            {
              "reference_id": "ref-407-8-003",
              "target_id": "408",
              "target_type": "section",
              "anchor_text": "section 408",
              "relationship": "related_to",
              "confidence": "medium"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "subsection",
          "number": "9",
          "id": "407-9",
          "indent": 0,
          "line_start": 19,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text": "Where a person, who is served with an order referred to in sub-section (1) or (4), estimates that advance tax payable on his current income would exceed the amount of advance tax specified in such order or intimated by him under sub-section (8), he shall pay such advance tax on the current income, calculated in the manner laid down in section 405 at the appropriate part or whole of such higher amount of advance tax as accords with his estimate, on or before the due date of the last instalment specified in section 408.",
          "children": [],
